@host = http://localhost:5112

### Register (run once)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!", "confirmPassword": "Passw0rd!" }

### Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### Protected endpoint: uses the token from the login response
GET {{host}}/api/games
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}


